   "created_at": "2026-07-07T11:24:43+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>Hi, I encountered some game-breaking bugs in Editor Mode. First, the 3D game view shrinks into a tiny rectangle in the center of the screen with a huge black background, and it cannot be resized or reset. Second, even after using [MMB] to free the cursor, the mouse input still leaks into the game, so moving the cursor to click UI buttons still rotates my in-game camera at the same time. Also, hitting keys spams \u201cCan not find sub command\u201d errors in the console. Please look into these layout and mouse focus issues. Thanks!</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
   "likes": 0
  },
