   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>If it\u2019s possible, it would be SUPER COOL. Many people would like to just clean up the maps to begin with - put back in the ground flying bushes that annoy me very much every time I see them, put on the ground some objects that somehow ignore the laws of gravity, or just remove some garbage to reduce the load on the computer. And the fact that someone will move the same objects is the least of the problems. Tarkov developers won\u2019t release patches for SPT, so we need a tool to fix things ourselves!</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
